credentials.description:
Sign in with the email address and password of your Leapmotor account.

**Tip:** create a second Leapmotor account and share the vehicle with it in the app. Then Home Assistant never logs your phone out.

{error}

confirm.description:
The Leapmotor server now presents a different certificate than the one remembered during setup:

- Fingerprint: `{fingerprint}`
- Issued by: {issuer}
- Valid until: {valid_until}

The remembered certificate was not about to expire, so the change is not accepted automatically. Until you decide, no data is sent to the server. Only confirm if you trust your network connection.
